// sorted lists, the merge loop kept as a running number, the start/end sort
// that makes one running value enough (covered intervals), the sweep-line
// count, and sort-by-end greedy. They build up to Meeting Rooms, Merge
// Intervals, Insert Interval, Non-overlapping Intervals and Meeting Rooms II
// without repeating them. Intervals here are closed unless a statement says
// otherwise. They follow docs/pedagogy.md like any problem.
